            "review_title": "Review at Lobster Bay Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Linh My\n30 contributions\n0\nGreat food for an affordable price\nJul 2019 • Couples\nGreat for family dinner and seafood lover. Best place to have fresh kingcrabs and lobsters, I can see them alive in the fish tanks next to the stair unlike many other seafood restaurant in VN using only frozen ones. Must try northern shrimps, cheese oysters as well !\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 8, 2019\nNa X\nThank you for enjoying the food at the restaurant. Pleased to welcome you the next time.\nWritten September 5, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
