            "review_text": "Deralm\nBeach City, TX47 contributions\n2\nTerrible Service\nMay 2018 • Couples\nTerrible service because they only have untrained kids working. They would not explain the menu even in Vietnamese. Ordered crab and they would not bring utensils to eat with. We had to ask for utensils and napkins. We had to ask for everything they should have brought. I will not return.\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 12, 2018",
