            "review_text": "nguyenthaihang\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam18 contributions\n2\nno table despite advance booking\nApr 2018\nwe went to this reataurant which has a new location now and despite advance booking there was no table. we showed up at the exact time of our booking (7:30pm) and four different waiters/waitresses asked for our booking. we repeated our booking information 4 times and they were pointing fingers to each other to find us a table. we lost our appetite after being there for 5 minutes and we so walked out of the restaurant. we went to another Cajun restaurant called Cajun Cua.\nRead more\nWritten April 28, 2018",
